{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/99bc06dfeb6fa45213e4b97b9a6dcd0a.avif?t=1771349057\" width=1427 height=650 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <strong>roguelite puzzle</strong> in which you have to lick and stick postage stamps of different shapes and sizes to collect points onto packages to send them!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/c0879943cb32bdb3c46644809c9a47cf.poster.avif?t=1771349057\" width=800 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/c0879943cb32bdb3c46644809c9a47cf.webm?t=1771349057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/c0879943cb32bdb3c46644809c9a47cf.mp4?t=1771349057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a novice postman, and by order of the Royal Postal Academy, you must restore an abandoned post office. You will be assisted by the inhabitants of the place\u2014the cutest little cockroaches!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c Roach-workers\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire moustached workers from over 40 candidates to receive useful bonuses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose who goes to work and who gets time off, upgrade the most useful ones and fire those you don't like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/a620f8665aa62555ff6436e13bf2d12f.poster.avif?t=1771349057\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/a620f8665aa62555ff6436e13bf2d12f.webm?t=1771349057\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/a620f8665aa62555ff6436e13bf2d12f.mp4?t=1771349057\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c Impatient Customers</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colorful characters, varied packages, and a ticking timer. Every order is unique!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3514630/extras/9d1053944f1a785159ded1bfb1afddf6.avif?t=1771349057\" width=1427 height=650 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to your first shift!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udc8c Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 roach-workers with various hobbies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 80 creations with unique advantages. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Polymino-stamps and various-shaped packages.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Color synergies and conflicts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The progress of the post office and rare cockroaches.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clients with timers and requests, Inspectors' checks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grade points that needs to be retained and restored.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choosing the starting set and difficulty before the shift.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com